WEBVTT

00:00:03.377 --> 00:00:05.279
Hello.
(chuckles nervously)
你好

00:00:05.313 --> 00:00:07.248
(pigs snort, squeal)

00:00:07.281 --> 00:00:09.550
(gasps)
Look! A unicorn horn!
看呀 是独角兽的角

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:12.353
*
看呀 是独角兽的角

00:00:12.386 --> 00:00:15.789
My little brain
is going to explode!
我的小脑袋瓜就要爆炸啦

00:00:15.823 --> 00:00:18.192
(groans):
Oh, Agnes, that's fake.
艾格妮丝 那是假的

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:19.560
Oh-ho. Ho-ho.

00:00:19.593 --> 00:00:21.295
It's real, all right.
那是真的好不好？

00:00:21.329 --> 00:00:23.397
-(gasps)
-That horn...
这只角是从弯弯树林弄来的

00:00:23.431 --> 00:00:25.533
came from the Crooked Forest,
这只角是从弯弯树林弄来的

00:00:25.566 --> 00:00:30.438
the only place on earth
where unicorns still live.
全世界只有那里还有独角兽活动着

00:00:30.471 --> 00:00:33.307
(derisive laughter)

00:00:35.609 --> 00:00:37.311
Huh?

00:00:37.345 --> 00:00:39.880
Laugh, laugh, all of you!
Ah-ha-ha! Ah-ha-ha!
笑 笑吧 随便你们

00:00:39.913 --> 00:00:41.882
They all think I'm crazy.
他们都觉得我疯了

00:00:41.915 --> 00:00:45.085
But I'm telling you,
I saw one once...
我跟你们说 我真见过独角兽

00:00:45.119 --> 00:00:47.488
with my own eye.
-而且是亲眼看到的
-等等

00:00:47.521 --> 00:00:50.258
Wai-Wai-Wait. You saw
a for-real-life unicorn?!
你是说你见过真正的独角兽？

00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:51.992
What did it look like?
(gasps)
它长什么样子？你有没有摸它？

00:00:52.025 --> 00:00:54.162
Did you pet it?
Did it smell like candy?
它长什么样子？你有没有摸它？

00:00:54.195 --> 00:00:55.429
Was it...
闻着是不是很甜？是不是毛茸茸的？

00:00:55.463 --> 00:00:57.431
fluffy...?!
闻着是不是很甜？是不是毛茸茸的？

00:00:57.465 --> 00:00:59.133
It was so fluffy...
小家伙毛茸茸的
我幸福得喘不过气来

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:02.002
(choked up):
I thought I was gonna die.
小家伙毛茸茸的
我幸福得喘不过气来

00:01:02.035 --> 00:01:05.439
-(grunts) Do you think maybe
I could find one, too? -Oh.
你说我也能找到独角兽吗？

00:01:05.473 --> 00:01:08.108
They say
if a maiden pure of heart
据说 如果一个拥有纯洁心灵的女孩

00:01:08.142 --> 00:01:12.280
goes into the Crooked Forest,
the unicorn will come
走进弯弯树林 独角兽就会出现

00:01:12.313 --> 00:01:15.916
and be hers... forever.
跟她一起走 永永远远

00:01:15.949 --> 00:01:18.486
(muffled squealing)
Mmm...

00:01:18.519 --> 00:01:21.121
(squealing rises in pitch)

00:01:21.155 --> 00:01:22.656
(high-pitch squealing scream)

00:01:22.690 --> 00:01:23.957
(gasps)
Agnes!
艾格妮丝

00:01:23.991 --> 00:01:25.293
Yaah!

00:01:25.326 --> 00:01:27.161
(martial arts grunting)

00:01:28.862 --> 00:01:31.699
-Goal!
-(screams)
射门

00:01:31.732 --> 00:01:34.034
-Excuse me. -(screams)
-(sobs)
不好意思

00:01:34.067 --> 00:01:35.936
(panting):
Girls, don't worry, I'm here.
姑娘们 别害怕 我来了
你没事吧？

00:01:35.969 --> 00:01:37.538
Are you okay?
姑娘们 别害怕 我来了
你没事吧？

00:01:37.571 --> 00:01:39.307
Yeah, we're fine.
没事 我们没事 你呢？

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:40.774
Are you?
没事 我们没事 你呢？

00:01:40.808 --> 00:01:42.843
Unicorns are really real!
独角兽真的是真的 我要去找独角兽

00:01:42.876 --> 00:01:45.713
-And I'm gonna find one...!
-LUCY: Aw...
独角兽真的是真的 我要去找独角兽

00:01:45.746 --> 00:01:47.181
(man grunts)

00:01:47.215 --> 00:01:49.783
(chuckles): Sorry.
Went a little Mama Bear on you.
抱歉 我刚刚紧张过度了

00:01:49.817 --> 00:01:51.852
You know, I heard
a scream and...
毕竟我听到了尖叫
好 好吧 你们继续

00:01:51.885 --> 00:01:53.687
Yeah, okay. Have a good one.
毕竟我听到了尖叫
好 好吧 你们继续

00:01:58.192 --> 00:02:00.160
-Wait for me here.
-Oh... (grunting)
你在这里等我

00:02:00.194 --> 00:02:02.095
Stop that! Ow! You kicked me.
-不要 别这样
-你踢到我了

00:02:04.498 --> 00:02:07.000
-(alarm blaring)
-Hey! Hey! What are you doing?
你干什么呢？

00:02:07.034 --> 00:02:09.537
-(laughs)
-Did you just steal candy?
-你下车是去偷糖果了？
-没错

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:12.640
-Yes! -That's a lot of effort
for two lollipops.
偷了两根棒棒糖还真是辛苦你了

00:02:12.673 --> 00:02:15.509
-(siren wailing)
-(policeman shouts)
（逍遥国语）

00:02:15.543 --> 00:02:18.479
(whistle blowing, bicycle bell,
ringing, toy horn honking)

00:02:18.512 --> 00:02:21.349
Oh-oh-no! the police!
What do we do, what do we do?!
不 警察来了 我们怎么办？

00:02:21.382 --> 00:02:24.752
(laughs)
Come on, this is gonna be fun!
我们走 这下子好玩了

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.390
(policemen shouting)
（逍遥国语）

00:02:29.423 --> 00:02:30.724
(tires squeal)
（逍遥国语）

00:02:32.926 --> 00:02:34.762
(Dru screams)
（逍遥国语）

00:02:34.795 --> 00:02:36.230
The police are gonna get us!
警察快抓住我们了 我好害怕 猪

00:02:36.264 --> 00:02:37.565
(screams)
I'm freaking out!
警察快抓住我们了 我好害怕 猪

00:02:37.598 --> 00:02:38.566
Pigs!
警察快抓住我们了 我好害怕 猪

00:02:41.435 --> 00:02:42.436
Cops!
警察

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:44.772
(blowing whistle, shouting)
（逍遥国语）

00:02:44.805 --> 00:02:46.974
(yelling, grunting)
（逍遥国语）

00:02:51.245 --> 00:02:53.514
(laughing)

00:02:53.547 --> 00:02:56.149
(policemen shouting,
pigs squealing)
（逍遥国语）

00:02:58.118 --> 00:03:00.087
Ha! Whoa! They're back!
追上来了

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:01.455
(shouting)
（逍遥国语）

00:03:01.489 --> 00:03:03.324
Ha-ha. All right.
看我的

00:03:11.164 --> 00:03:12.400
(policemen shouting)
（逍遥国语）

00:03:19.773 --> 00:03:21.241
(burbling)

00:03:21.275 --> 00:03:24.211
(both laughing)

00:03:24.244 --> 00:03:26.447
Ooh, ooh, man, that was crazy!
兄弟 你真的太厉害了

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:28.716
We were so close
to getting busted.
我们差一点点就被抓住了

00:03:28.749 --> 00:03:32.286
Tell me about it. I thought you
were going to pee your pants.
你还好意思说
我以为你吓得要尿裤子了

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:34.588
-DRU: I did!
-You did!
-我尿了
-你尿了

00:03:34.622 --> 00:03:36.590
(both laughing)
-我尿了
-你尿了

00:03:37.858 --> 00:03:39.827
(Minions groaning tiredly)

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:44.465
(speaking Minionese)

00:03:44.498 --> 00:03:46.500
-(stomach grumbling)
-Ah.

00:03:46.534 --> 00:03:49.136
Hey, Mel.
(speaking Minionese)

00:03:49.169 --> 00:03:51.138
(others speaking Minionese)

00:03:51.171 --> 00:03:52.940
Huh? La pizza.

00:03:52.973 --> 00:03:54.908
(shouting excitedly
in Minionese)

00:03:54.942 --> 00:03:56.276
(Minion yells)

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:58.812
MINIONS (chanting):
Pizza! Pizza! Pizza!

00:04:00.348 --> 00:04:02.683
MINIONS:
Pizza! Pizza! Pizza!

00:04:02.716 --> 00:04:04.151
-Huh? Hey!
-Pizza...!

00:04:04.184 --> 00:04:05.619
-What are you doing!
-(grunts)
你们干什么？有人闯入

00:04:05.653 --> 00:04:08.489
Intruders! Intruders!
你们干什么？有人闯入

00:04:08.522 --> 00:04:10.458
*
（A舞台）

00:04:11.959 --> 00:04:14.027
-(dogs barking)
-GUARD: There they are!
他们在那儿 站住 不许动 站住

00:04:14.061 --> 00:04:16.497
-Stop!
-Hey, you! Don't move!
他们在那儿 站住 不许动 站住

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:18.532
-Halt!
-(screaming)
他们在那儿 站住 不许动 站住

00:04:21.969 --> 00:04:23.303
(barking)
（B舞台）

00:04:23.337 --> 00:04:24.972
Call for backup!
请求支援

00:04:25.005 --> 00:04:27.207
(Mel speaking Minionese)

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:29.009
(Minions panting)

00:04:29.042 --> 00:04:30.143
(all gasp)

00:04:30.177 --> 00:04:31.412
Uh... ooh-ah.

00:04:35.916 --> 00:04:37.551
(low whirring)

00:04:37.585 --> 00:04:39.152
Ooh, uh...

00:04:39.186 --> 00:04:42.322
(orchestra playing
"Modern Major-General's Song")

00:04:42.356 --> 00:04:44.725
(speaking Minionese)

00:04:46.059 --> 00:04:47.895
No. No, no. No. No, no, no.

00:04:47.928 --> 00:04:49.663
(gasps)

00:04:49.697 --> 00:04:50.798
Uh...

00:04:50.831 --> 00:04:52.232
-uh... (whimpers)
-(electronic feedback)

00:04:52.265 --> 00:04:55.736
(singing "Modern Major-
General's Song" in Minionese)

00:05:04.845 --> 00:05:08.248
(continues singing
in Minionese)

00:05:11.719 --> 00:05:13.220
(groans)

00:05:13.253 --> 00:05:15.689
(resumes singing in Minionese)

00:05:15.723 --> 00:05:18.526
(other Minions singing chorus)

00:05:18.559 --> 00:05:20.327
*

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:23.063
(song building in intensity)

00:05:23.096 --> 00:05:25.699
* Ah...

00:05:25.733 --> 00:05:27.234
(Minion continues singing)

00:05:27.267 --> 00:05:29.002
GUARD:
Get 'em! Go! Go!
抓住他们 快

00:05:29.036 --> 00:05:30.237
(continues singing
in Minionese)

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:31.739
-(slap)
-Ow!

00:05:31.772 --> 00:05:33.340
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:05:33.373 --> 00:05:36.376
(all singing in Minionese)

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:37.778
*

